WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.425
This is the file the chapter
adds: one row per call.

2
00:00:03.425 --> 00:00:08.712
Every task first gets a token from its
own OAuth client and integration user.

3
00:00:08.712 --> 00:00:11.176
The drift push posts findings through the

4
00:00:11.176 --> 00:00:13.851
scripted REST resource,
as the finding writer.

5
00:00:13.851 --> 00:00:16.560
The re-read task lists waiting findings,

6
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:21.488
patches each one and uploads an evidence
attachment, all as the verifier.

7
00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:25.388
And the evidence export reads the
same table under its own role,

8
00:00:25.388 --> 00:00:29.063
the evidence reader, which can
read but not change anything.

9
00:00:29.063 --> 00:00:32.280
Every row names the vendor
page that justifies it.
